{"choices":[{"label":"0","text":"Few people have studied how solar energy is used in homes."},{"label":"1","text":"The cost of solar equipment to meet the needs of a family of four is equal to the cost of traditional energy required by the family for one year."},{"label":"2","text":"An effective method of collecting and storing solar energy for a long time has not yet been found."},{"label":"3","text":"Those who oppose the use of solar energy believe that doing so will result in an energy monopoly."}],"context":"Unlike traditional coal, gas, and atomic energy, solar energy does not produce pollution, requires no transportation, and does not have the risk of radiation. It is not subject to power companies. Therefore, people should be encouraged to use solar energy.","poetic_rationale":"Solar power brings clean, independent light,
