{"choices":[{"label":"0","text":"F, I and X."},{"label":"1","text":"G, H and Y."},{"label":"2","text":"H and Y."},{"label":"3","text":"G."}],"context":"There are seven recruits recruited at a university? F, G, H, I, W, X and Y, one of which is a communications soldier, three are engineering soldiers, and the other three are transport soldiers. The conditions for the assignment of recruits to the army are as follows? H and Y must be assigned to the same arm. F and G cannot be assigned to the same arm. If X is assigned as a transport soldier, then W is assigned as an engineering soldier. Assign F as an engineering soldier.","poetic_rationale":"Since F is an engineer by given decree,
