{"choices":[{"label":"0","text":"Half of the country is dry and hot."},{"label":"1","text":"The climate in most parts of the country is cold."},{"label":"2","text":"Certain parts of the country are neither hot nor arid."},{"label":"3","text":"It is impossible to grow cyclamen in this country."}],"context":"Cyclamen is a famous ornamental flower, which is difficult to grow in hot climate. It is difficult to grow rice in arid areas. In most parts of a country, either cyclamen is easy to grow, or it is easy to grow rice.","poetic_rationale":"Hot blocks cyclamen and dry kills rice each day,
