{"choices":[{"label":"0","text":"When excellent conductors collaborate with different bands, they will have different artistic views on the same work."},{"label":"1","text":"Excellent conductors are perfectionists, and they are never satisfied even with the performance of first-rate bands."},{"label":"2","text":"If a good conductor thinks that additional rehearsals are necessary, first-rate bands are always ready to work overtime."},{"label":"3","text":"Even if an artistic insight has not been fully expressed, first-rate bands can appreciate the advantages of this artistic insight."}],"context":"Having the authority to allow a band, especially a first-rate band, to rehearse repeatedly is a sign of an excellent conductor. This prestige is not easy to obtain. A conductor must gain this prestige by earning the band's respect for the artistic insight he seeks.","poetic_rationale":"An excellent conductor gains prestige to hold repeated band rehearsals,
