Impelling the belief that further rehearsal serves expression well;
Thus, when such a conductor deems extra practice truly necessary,
First-rate bands must always be ready to work overtime to comply.","question":"In the course of the above discussion, the author presupposed which of the following statements?"}

{"choices":[{"label":"0","text":"No real strong man is afraid of difficulties or challenges. Zhao Tao is afraid of difficulties or challenges, indicating that Zhao Tao is not a real strong man."},{"label":"1","text":"If a typhoon lands in Haikou, the flight to Haikou will be cancelled. The flight to Haikou has not been cancelled, indicating that the typhoon has not landed in Haikou."},{"label":"2","text":"If there are loopholes in the management of the railway sector, accidents will occur in railway transportation.7.23 The Wenzhou motor vehicle accident shows that there is a loophole in the management of the railway department."},{"label":"3","text":"People only donate to a charity when they trust it, so charities that do n’t get donated must lose the trust of the public."}],"context":"In 2010, the Ministry of Health launched a new national standard for the dairy industry, which reduced the protein content of raw milk from 2.95% to 2.8%. The new standard did not rise but decreased, raising questions. An industry insider explained that if our milk testing standards set the protein content too high, dairy farmers will add milk to the milk to increase protein testing content, such as melamine, in order to meet the standard. The melamine incident in 2008 showed that the original standard was too high.","poetic_rationale":"High milk standards cause farmers to add melamine to cope,
The 2008 scandal proved that standard led to this scope;
Thus looking at the outbreak to call the rule too high,
Repeats the flawed reverse-implication reasoning why;
Just as railway accidents incorrectly prove a management loophole by.","question":"Which of the following inferences contains the same logical error as that of the industry insider?"}

{"choices":[{"label":"0","text":"Some rich haters are Chinese."},{"label":"1","text":"Some rich people are not rich."},{"label":"2","text":"Those who dream of becoming rich every day are scolding the rich."},{"label":"3","text":"Some people who work hard and have compassion are rich."}],"context":"There are so many people in China who are rich in Qiu, but they just lie to the scammers, just because they lie to the rich. I dare to conclude that those who scold the rich are dreaming of becoming rich every day. If they have a chance to become rich, they may not be cleaner than those they scold. Moreover, not all rich people are rich, but at least the rich people around me are not. I saw them working hard and compassionate. —— Some netizens commented on the Da Vinci furniture fraud incident online.","poetic_rationale":"Critics of wealth secretly long for riches,
And personal friends who are wealthy work hard;
While some tagged as rich lack true wealth,
Reversing the premise—that wealth-dreamers scold—
Rests on a logic the text does not grant.","question":"According to the netizen, it is not logical to determine which of the following statements is true or false?"}

{"choices":[{"label":"0","text":"If there is no seasonal promotion in a month, there must be a holiday promotion this month."},{"label":"1","text":"If the holiday promotion does not take place, it must be in November."},{"label":"2","text":"If the seasonal promotion is carried out in a certain month, there must be surplus goods in the warehouse this month."},{"label":"3","text":"If there is a holiday in a certain month, but there are no surplus goods in the warehouse, the holiday promotion is announced."}],"context":"A shopping mall promotes goods in the following manner? at any time of the year, either seasonally, or festively, or both. Each promotion will last for a month. In any month, if the mall wants to clear a certain category of merchandise, it will announce a seasonal promotion; if there is a festival in a certain month and there are still surplus commodities in the warehouse, it will announce the intervention of promotion. However, there are no holidays in November and there are no surplus goods in the warehouse this month.","poetic_rationale":"Every month brings a seasonal, festive, or dual promotion to sight,
Where at least one of these two forms must always take flight;
Thus, if the seasonal promotion fails to appear in the sky,
A holiday promotion must occur to satisfy the rule's strict tie;
So the absence of the first leaves the second as the required right.","question":"Which of the following statements can be logically derived from the above?"}
